Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 00:32:00 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] test(warshad): cover pairing duplicate, plugin
 disconnect, and harness db errors (R1 F1)

Add unit tests covering three surfaced error behaviors:
- Duplicate device pairing creation surfaces DeviceAlreadyPaired (-32000)
- Disabling an unconnected plugin surfaces MCP disconnect error (-32000)
- Active harness query on corrupt DB surfaces error (-32000) instead of default
---
